<div class="container mt-4" style="padding: 20px;">
  <h1>About This Project</h1>
  <p>This application is a Ruby on Rails web project built to track cryptocurrency market data.</p>

  <h3>Data Sources</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>CoinGecko API:</strong> We pull live cryptocurrency market statistics, coin names, symbols, pricing, and category classifications directly from the CoinGecko public API endpoints.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Database Structure</h3>
  <p>The app utilizes a relational database with a one-to-many association: a <strong>Category</strong> has many <strong>Coins</strong>, and each <strong>Coin</strong> belongs to a <strong>Category</strong>.</p>
</div>